gun work towards a Demonic Portal. Two lesser works come first, and the Portal will stand in a city holding one of them.","kind":"bad","cue":"ending","at":[8,32]},{"turn":171,"player":1,"text":"The Radiant Kingdom of Bram tears up the peace. Its own people are not sure what to make of that, and say so.","kind":"bad","cue":"city-lost","subject":"peace-broken"},{"turn":171,"player":0,"text":"The Radiant Kingdom of Bram tears up the peace. They will want watching, and they will not be believed twice.","kind":"bad","cue":"city-lost","subject":"peace-broken"},{"turn":171,"player":0,"text":"Goblin Sapper holds against Footman.","kind":"combat","at":[24,38],"actor":18},{"turn":171,"player":1,"text":"Footman is destroyed attacking.","kind":"bad","at":[25,37]},{"turn":171,"player":0,"text":"Axethrower throws its axe at Three Footmen.","kind":"combat","cue":"axe-throw","at":[24,36],"actor":105},{"turn":171,"player":1,"text":"Three Footmen defeats Axethrower after 12 rounds.","kind":"combat","at":[23,35],"actor":44},{"turn":171,"player":0,"text":"Axethrower is wiped out.","kind":"bad","at":[23,35]},{"turn":171,"player":1,"text":"Two Archers defeats Troll after 20 rounds.","kind":"combat","at":[26,37],"actor":111},{"turn":171,"player":0,"text":"Troll is wiped out.","kind":"bad","at":[26,37]},{"turn":171,"player":2,"text":"Animated Guardian holds against Two Archers.","kind":"combat","at":[50,23],"actor":155},{"turn":171,"player":1,"text":"Two Archers is destroyed attacking.","kind":"bad","at":[49,24]},{"turn":171,"player":1,"text":"All 2 of them, at once. The Radiant Kingdom of Bram takes it about as well as expected.","kind":"bad","at":[49,24]},{"turn":171,"player":1,"text":"Something far larger comes up the stairs. It has taken it three turns to decide you are serious.","kind":"bad","at":[38,16]},{"turn":172,"player":0,"text":"Bonechew completes Two Orcs.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":172,"player":0,"text":"Mudhole completes Axethrower.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{